## What to check on the result

- The four rivet bars are identical in tone and spacing.
- Exactly four fish slots, one row.
- The window recess is dark blue-black, not green.
- The bottom-right corner is plain rail and wood so the reel emblem sits over it.
- The plaque and key faces are plain, so text can sit on them.

## Then

Attach the chosen template in the same chat and generate each piece from it,
wall to wall (no green margin, the subject fills the image), at the size the
piece is used. The per-piece prompts are written against the template once
it exists, in `ui-skin-brass-prompts.md`.
